menu "dsync audio"

    config DSYNC_AUDIO_RING_KB
        int "PCM ring buffer size (KiB)"
        default 32
        range 4 128
        help
            Ring between the A2DP data callback (producer) and the I2S writer
            task (consumer). Bigger absorbs longer network stalls; the frame is
            dropped if it overflows.

endmenu
